# Runtime payload for SimOpenTrackDay v0.1
# One entry per line, paths relative to repository root. Blank lines and lines
# starting with '#' are ignored. Globs ending in /*.lua are expanded against
# direct children. Files listed here are copied verbatim into the user's
# selected <AssettoCorsaRoot>/apps/lua/SimOpenTrackDay/ tree, after that
# directory is wiped clean.
